{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1089515-combining-automatic-actions","id":1089515,"title":"Combining automatic actions?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-07T18:44:37-07:00","id":1089515,"title":"Combining automatic actions?","content":"Lots of things are mentioned as automatic actions - moving flat out, nocking a bow, reloading a gun. It seems to imply that these need to be multiple actions, since otherwise you would just move your full speed all the time.<br /> <br /> However, there are no rules on the multiple action section for adding automatic actions to the split since they have no dice pool. Is the implication they cannot be split? That would make bows pretty bad, which is sad for a fae Chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13398-fynikz","name":"fynikz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T22:36:41-07:00","id":1089587,"title":"","content":"This is why I HIGHLY prefer the old Revised or the new Vampire 20th: Dark Ages multiple action rules, really. They can take into account automatic actions.<br /> <br /> Revised: The first action gets -X dice, where X is the amount of multiple actions you take. Every action after that gets -1 additional dice<br /> <br /> Examples:<br /> <br /> 1st action: -3 dice<br /> 2nd action: -4 dice<br /> 3rd action: -5 dice<br /> <br /> V20: DA does it differently: Every action gets -1 dice, +1 difficulty, but you don't have the big dice hit at the start<br /> Vampire 20th: Dark Ages<br /> 1st action: -1 dice, +1 difficulty<br /> 2nd action: -2 dice, +2 difficulty<br /> 3rd action: -3 dice, +3 difficulty<br /> <br /> Both systems require you, of course, to announce the amount of actions beforehand. And if one of those actions is automatic, simply blank its dice/difficulty rating in the tables above. The other actions still get influenced by the total amount of actions you took, automatic or not, and still depend on the order of when what happens.<br /> <br /> Sadly all the other 20th systems (Including modern V20) have reverted to the 2nd edition 'split dice pools' multiple action rule - which does not explain at all how automatic actions are handled if you do multiple actions. IMO, quite an oversight. :|<br /> <br /> A simple way to houserule it, of course, is to say that automatic actions simply have no influence on multiple action dice pools in the 2nd ed/20th system like in C20. However, this lets you take automatic actions without any penalty to rolled actions because of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":6606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","user":"Ambrosia","date":". 05-08-2017, 07:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-09T06:09:22-07:00","id":1090256,"title":"","content":"Thanks for that input. I might just end up having to keep the revised system... I think the biggest problem this has is bunks, followed by moving flat out. You'd always use a bunk if you can use it literally for free (if it has no dice to roll for it) and then also use a cantrip. Though given base difficulty 8, maybe that isn't THAT big a problem.<br /> <br /> Another option I suppose would be to largely eliminate automatic actions. An action is either free/reflexive (knocking a bow, invoking) or you can't split actions to do it (moving flat out, using a bunk with no dice pool).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13398-fynikz","name":"fynikz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-09T06:53:09-07:00","id":1090272,"title":"","content":"I suppose there's another argument to be made: those things are only automatic because you can easily do them in three seconds if you're not doing anything else. But when you're attempting to do multiple things all at once, perhaps some of them stop being automatic? If you're trying to reload while running, for instance, you might need to make a Dexterity + Firearms roll for the reload action, as you're distracted. That's how clumsy changelings drop bullets!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}